## Installation & Management

This AGENTS.md was generated by the **jar-skills** plugin installed by Javier Arancibia.

**To uninstall this skill:**
```bash
# If installed locally in this project
jar-skills uninstall --local --restore-agents

# If installed globally
jar-skills uninstall --global
```

**To reinstall or switch modes:**
```bash
# Install globally
jar-skills install --global

# Install locally in this project
jar-skills install --local --project .
```
